<title>USA: Morgan's Foods Q2 shr break-even vs $0.01.</title>
<headline>Morgan's Foods Q2 shr break-even vs $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>BEACHWOOD, Ohio 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>8/18/96		   8/13/95</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.00		    $0.01</p>
<p> Net			     29			 95</p>
<p> Revs			 9,554		    9,904</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,816		   17,816</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    loss		$0.01   profit	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net    loss		  123   profit	 1,636</p>
<p> Revs			18,559		   21,520</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,816		   17,816</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Morgan's Foods Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said in a statement net income for fiscal 1996 year to date includes a $1.68 million gain on the sale of 24 restaurants. Without the gain on the sale, the net loss for the 24 weeks ended August 13 would be $45,000, it said.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal 1996 year-to-date also included a $95,000 charge resulting from the loss on disposal of leasehold improvements and equipment from two closed restaurants.</p>
